        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Courtney Love, Dave Callahan, Paul Clark, Andy Golding, Andy Bolton, Frank Stebbing\n- Bands: Hole, The Wolfhounds\n- Places: Romford, UK\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, actress, visual artist, frontwoman\n\nFacts:\n- Courtney Love was born Courtney Michelle Harrison on July 9, 1964.\n- Courtney Love is an American singer, songwriter, actress, and visual artist.\n- The Wolfhounds are an indie pop/noise pop band formed in Romford, UK in 1985 by Dave Callahan, Paul Clark, Andy Golding, Andy Bolton, and Frank Stebbing.\n- Courtney Love formed the alternative rock band Hole in 1989 and rose to prominence as its frontwoman.\n- The Wolfhounds were originally active until 1990.",
